{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pulpy - Complete API Collection",
    "description": "Complete API collection with all routes including Publishers, Offers, Advertisers, Assignments, Tracking, Postback, and Reporting. Supports both Basic Auth and JWT Bearer tokens.\n\n**Dashboard API Updates (v2.2.0):**\n- Added 6 new dashboard endpoints for frontend integration\n- Main Dashboard Stats: Returns aggregated KPI data with today, yesterday, and MTD values\n- Top Offers: Returns top offers by conversions\n- Performance Chart: Returns time-series data for clicks and conversions\n- Top Affiliates: Returns top affiliates with conversion counts\n- Info Cards: Returns active offers, pending affiliates, account manager info\n- Top Countries: Returns country-wise statistics for world map visualization\n\n**Assignment Changes (v2.1.0):**\n- Tracking URLs are now dynamic and generated at runtime (not stored in database)\n- `destination_url` replaces `offer_url` (optional override, defaults to `offer.offer_url`)\n- `callback_url` is optional override (defaults to `publisher.global_postback_url`)\n- URLs must contain `{click_id}` or `{rcid}` macro when provided\n- Use `/assignments/:id/tracking-url` to get dynamic tracking URL for publishers",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "2.2.0"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{auth_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "auth_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "basic_auth", "value": "Basic YWRtaW5AYm5nLmNvbTphZG1pbjEyMw==", "type": "string", "description": "Base64 encoded admin@bng.com:admin123" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (res.data && res.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', res.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@bng.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","auth","register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (res.data && res.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', res.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@bng.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] }
          }
        },
